MU is a fab-intensive IDM with significant CapEx exposure. Its customer concentration in the data center (cloud providers like AWS, Google Cloud) provides stability but leaves it vulnerable to inventory digestion risks. The company faces intense competition from substitutes like Kioxia and ChangXin Memory.  

